{
  "rule_version": "qr-redact/4",
  "description": "AUTHORED golden for the Quarry secret-redaction rules (WS12). Not generated. Every secret is stored as an array of fragments that the loader joins, so no secret-shaped literal exists in the repository. profile=live: the secret must be masked under both profiles. profile=durable: it must be masked under Durable and left alone under Live. applies_to names who must pass the case: quarry (quarry_core::redaction) and mp (the Model Plane mp-scrub crate, WS12.S4). To change a rule: edit the module, bump RULE_VERSION, edit this file, refresh the .sha256 pin beside it, update the digest in scripts/tests/zdr-contract-sync.test.sh, and re-vendor every copy.",
